  "label": "Anti-Latino/Hispanic Racism",
  "description": "The meme is an example of anti-Latino/hispanic racism, a form of systemic discrimination targeting people of Latin American descent. It uses racist tropes and dehumanizing imagery to portray Mexicans as primitive, lazy, and dangerous. This racism is often rooted in xenophobia, economic anxiety, and historical prejudice against Latin American immigrants in the United States and other countries.",
